      "content": "Hey, I'm seeing some weird damage on my tomato plants in the greenhouse. There are these tiny, irregular holes appearing on the leaves, and it's starting to spread across the whole batch. I can't see much when I look closely, but the damage is definitely there. Any idea what kind of pests might be causing this?",
